 `PATH_KEYS` entry and deny under active step5\",\n  \"| class (d) | `unknown` | `judge-error` |\",\n  \"`unrelated-import` and `other-symbol`\",\n  \"**Spec (v1.4 items).** Lines recording OD-2\",\n  \"UNWIRED` returning 2\",\n  \"exit 0 on PASS and on HALT agy_tdd_hook_unverified after\",\n ],\n \"spec\": [\n  \"UNWIRED reason=<any of the seven>\",\n  \"step5:implementer_unresolved` (a `no-record` or\",\n  \"when a `leg=6a-prime` entry exists\",\n  \"per class-(b) tool\",\n  \"fixes them.\",\n  \"With it `active` or `unknown`:\",\n  \"kind=tool-not-admitted\",\n  \"D-16 Directory target refused\",\n  \"returns 2 on a self-check\",\n ],\n \"plan\": [\n  \"on `UNWIRED` writes no prompt and\",\n  \"exits 0.\",\n ],\n \"inv\": [\n  \"**exit 0** on a normal verdict (PASS or FAIL)\",\n ],\n}\nfor key, path in files.items():\n    text = path.read_text()\n    print(f\"=== {key} ===\")\n    for n in needles[key]:\n        print(f\"  {'OK' if n in text else 'MISSING'}: {n[:80]}\")\nPY","truncated":false,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"description":"Verify quote spans exist verbatim in source files","current_dir":"/Users/kimhawk/.local/state/h-mad/grok-audit-surface/run-ab2c85dc2e25-20261024T132452Z/roots/gas-root-d8-s2v1-isogl9ls","output_file":"/Users/kimhawk/.grok/sessions/%2FUsers%2Fkimhawk%2F.local%2Fstate%2Fh-mad%2Fgrok-audit-surface%2Frun-ab2c85dc2e25-20261024T132452Z%2Froots%2Fgas-root-d8-s2v1-isogl9ls/01a16e83-9639-7733-9916-502222a5a3fb/terminal/call-439295d4-e9f2-4945-a6e7-f32da3612aba-45.log","total_bytes":933},"locations":[]}
